        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Species: Endoclita excrescens\n- Genera: Dendromecon, Castanea, Nicotiana, Quercus, Raphanus\n- Concepts: food plants, genus species richness\n\nFacts:\n- Endoclita excrescens is a flowering species used as a food plant by a genus not named in the chunk.\n- The genus that uses Endoclita excrescens as a food plant contains more species than the genus Dendromecon.\n- Other food plants mentioned in the chunk include Castanea, Nicotiana, Quercus, and Raphanus.",
